            <div class="nsw-content-block__content">
              <h3 class="nsw-content-block__title">Get started</h3>
              <p class="nsw-content-block__copy">Practical guidance and tools to get you started with the NSW Design System.</p>
              <ul class="nsw-content-block__list">
                <li><a href="/get-started/for-designers.html">For designers</a></li>
                <li><a href="/get-started/for-developers.html">For developers</a></li>
                <li><a href="/get-started/figma-ui-kit.html">Figma UI Kit</a></li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="nsw-col nsw-col-md-6 nsw-col-xl-4">
